WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
MAMO helps you with everyday technology.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:07.200
Today, we'll show you how MAMO helps an older adult join an online doctor's appointment.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.200
I have a doctor's meeting coming up soon.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.560
Could you check if my connection is good?

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.000
Yes, your Wi-Fi is connected.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.800
Could you text my son, John, that I will be joining my doctor's meeting soon?

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.800
Sure.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.480
I've let John know you're joining the doctor's appointment.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:29.200
I know my doctor emailed me a Zoom link for the meeting, but I seem to have lost it.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.440
I know it was open in my Safari browser.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.480
Could you join that for me?

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.480
No problem.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:40.280
I'll find the meeting link and help you join.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.680
During my meeting, could you take notes?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.680
Of course.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.400
I'll take notes during your appointment.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.000
Nice.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.200
Here's a summary of your appointment.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.400
The doctor reminded you to take your blood pressure medication

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.600
and scheduled to follow up appointment for December 5th at 3pm.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.200
Could you text my son, John, about this info?

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.600
I'd like to let him know what I went over during my doctor's meeting.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.400
Done.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.000
I've sent John a summary of your doctor's appointment.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Nice.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Thank you.
